{"availability":"available","full":"HelgeSverre/dart-blade-parser","name":"dart-blade-parser","description":"Pure Dart parser for Laravel Blade templates with AST generation and formatting","category":"Other","language":"Dart","stars":30,"forks":2,"created":"2025-10-07T13:21:55Z","updated":"2026-06-04T10:25:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://blade-formatter.vercel.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://blade-formatter.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:47:55.606Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:47:55.606Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:47:55.606Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:55.766Z","stars":30,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-13T02:12:18.774Z","stars":30,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-19T02:47:55.606Z","stars":30,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Note: This project is stable and production-ready. The core parser and formatter are well-tested with 1450+ tests covering edge cases, performance, and real-world scenarios. API breaking changes will follow semantic versioning.","A pure Dart parser for Laravel Blade templates. Produces a typed AST with full support for Blade directives, components, Alpine.js, and Livewire attributes. Includes robust error recovery, JSON serialization, and an idempotent formatter.","This library tokenizes and parses Blade templates into a traversable abstract syntax tree. It handles the full complexity of modern Blade templates including nested directives, component slots, Alpine.js event handlers, and Livewire wire:model bindings."],"features":["108 Blade directives (@if, @foreach, @section, @component, @auth, @livewireStyles, etc.)","Blade components () with named and default slots","Alpine.js attributes (x-data, x-show, @click, :bind) with modifier parsing","Livewire attributes (wire:click, wire:model.live) with full modifier support","Echo statements ({{ }}, {!! !!}, {{{ }}})"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/dart-bla